 - **[React](https://react.dev/)**: Used for UI components.
 - **[Tailwind CSS](https://tailwindcss.com/)**: For styling the application.
 - **[Astro DB](https://docs.astro.build/en/guides/database/)**: Powers the comments feature, using a libSQL-compatible database.
+
+## Text translation
+
+Lingua is available at `/devtools-times/` and `/devtools-times/translate`. The news homepage is at `/devtools-times/news`. It supports 16 languages, language swapping, device speech playback, copying, and local saved translations/history.
+
+`POST /devtools-times/api/translate` accepts JSON `{ "text": "Hello", "source": "en", "target": "fr" }`. Text is limited to 500 characters and split into UTF-8-safe segments for MyMemory. No API key is required; the public service has daily usage limits. Requests time out after 15 seconds, and service/quota errors are displayed in the workspace. Text is sent to MyMemory; saved items and the last 30 translations stay in browser local storage.
+
+Run `pnpm install`, `pnpm build`, then `pnpm start`.
